oy, Warm greetings from the University of Antique Student Government! The University of Antique Tario Lim Memorial Campus Student Government (UASG) serve as the primary organization that connects the University Administration and the student body. The UASG represents the voice and interests of the students, enabling them to elect representatives to lead for the Academic Year 2025-2026. In line with this the University of Antique- Tario Lim Memorial Campus (UASG) will conduct an Acquaintance Party to strengthen relationships among students to foster camaraderie, respect, and uniting students as one community. Very truly yours, JESSICA N. DAYONOT UASG, Senator Noted by: JERU AVRIL CRYZ UASG, Vice President NINA M. ETORCITA Adviser, UASG',137,'Activity Design',62.74,'[]','[]','null','\"{\\\"provider\\\":\\\"ML Model\\\",\\\"model_id\\\":\\\"29\\\",\\\"suggested_category\\\":\\\"Activity Design\\\",\\\"category_confidence\\\":62.74,\\\"original_prediction\\\":\\\"Activity Design\\\",\\\"fallback_used\\\":false,\\\"word_count\\\":137,\\\"extracted_text\\\":\\\"UNIVERSITY OF ANTIQUE STUDENT GOVERNMENT tlmc.usg@antiquespride.edu.ph March 11, 2025 MR. ROY BANDOJA Director, Sports Development Unit University of Antique Tario-Lim Memorial Campus Dear Sir Roy, Warm greetings from the University of Antique Student Government! The University of Antique Tario Lim Memorial Campus Student Government (UASG) serve as the primary organization that connects the University Administration and the student body. The UASG represents the voice and interests of the students, enabling them to elect representatives to lead for the Academic Year 2025-2026. In line with this the University of Antique- Tario Lim Memorial Campus (UASG) will conduct an Acquaintance Party to strengthen relationships among students to foster camaraderie, respect, and uniting students as one community. Very truly yours, JESSICA N. DAYONOT UASG, Senator Noted by: JERU AVRIL CRYZ UASG, Vice President NINA M. ETORCITA Adviser, UASG\\\"}\"','ML Model',0,'2026-05-19 12:52:45'),(141,140,'Office of Student Affairs and Services UNIVERSITY OF ANTIQUE STUDENT GOVERNMENT tlmc.uasg@antiquespride.edu.ph Resolution No. 13, series of 2025 A RESOLUTION TO CONDUCT A COMMUNITY OUTREACH PROGRAM AT BARANGAY, LAPAZ AND BARANGAY PITAC, TIBIAO, ANTIQUE. WHEREAS, the University of Antique Student Government serves as a medium of expression for student ideals; WHEREAS, the student body acknowledges its responsibility to strengthen its commitment to community engagement and extend social involvement; WHEREAS, the student body decided to conduct a Community Outreach Program to be held at Barangay Lapaz and Barangay Pitac, Tibiao Antique; WHEREAS, the said activity aims to foster community spirit and provide assistance to identified learners in need; NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED, that the University of Antique Student Government shall conduct a Community Outreach Program at Barangay Lapaz and Barangay Pitac, Tibiao Antique; RESOLVED, the members of the student body have expressed their fu',527,'Resolution',90.81,'[]','[]','null','\"{\\\"provider\\\":\\\"ML Model\\\",\\\"model_id\\\":\\\"29\\\",\\\"suggested_category\\\":\\\"Resolution\\\",\\\"category_confidence\\\":90.81,\\\"original_prediction\\\":\\\"Resolution\\\",\\\"fallback_used\\\":false,\\\"word_count\\\":527,\\\"extracted_text\\\":\\\"Office of Student Affairs and Services UNIVERSITY OF ANTIQUE STUDENT GOVERNMENT tlmc.uasg@antiquespride.edu.ph Resolution No. 13, series of 2025 A RESOLUTION TO CONDUCT A COMMUNITY OUTREACH PROGRAM AT BARANGAY, LAPAZ AND BARANGAY PITAC, TIBIAO, ANTIQUE. WHEREAS, the University of Antique Student Government serves as a medium of expression for student ideals; WHEREAS, the student body acknowledges its responsibility to strengthen its commitment to community engagement and extend social involvement; WHEREAS, the student body decided to conduct a Community Outreach Program to be held at Barangay Lapaz and Barangay Pit