, \"sentiment\": [], \"confidence\": 95}','nlpcloud',4047,'2026-05-21 21:50:22'),(201,200,'OFFICE OF STUDENT AFFAIRS AND SERVICES           UNIVERSITY OF ANTIQUE STUDENT GOVERNMENT          tlmc.uasg@antiquespride.edu.ph March 13, 2025 ANGEL B. BIADORA NSTP Coordinator  University of Antique Tario-Lim Memorial Campus Greetings! The University of Antique Student Government (UASG) serves as a medium of expression for the ideals and aspirations of every student of the University, promotes, and protects student’s welfare and interest, develops their potentials, skills, and dynamic leadership by organizing and carrying out school activities, service projects, and plan events that contribute for the welfare of the school and the community. In line with this, the UASG will conduct a Leadership Training 2025 with a theme, “Empowering YoUng LeAders: Celebrating Tradition and Culture” on April 4-5, 2025 at the Recreational and Fitness Center (RFC). Moreover, this training aims to develop leadership skills, teamwork, and discipline among the participants. Furthermore, I am writing this letter to formally request the assistance of 25 ROTC officers. We believe that the presence and guidance of the ROTC officers will significantly enhance the program by providing assistance to maintain order all throughout the said event. The ROTC officers will also take part in the event which will foster participation and collaboration between the UASG and the ROTC. We are hoping for your kind and favorable consideration on this matter. Thank you very much! Very truly yours, ESTELITO T. AMAR UASG, Senator Noted by: NINIA ROSE M. ETORCITA Adviser, UASG JEFFREY T. IMPORTANTE, MAEd Co-Adviser, UASG Recommending Approval: ANGEL B. BIADORA Coordinator, NSTP Approved: PORFERIO S. BANGCAYA, PhD Campus Director',251,'Proposal',30.00,'[]','[]','null','{\"method\": \"Pattern Matching\", \"category\": \"Proposal\", \"entities\": [], \"keywords\": [], \"provider\": \"Keyword Fallback\", \"sentiment\": [], 