 and other concerned offices for their approval and support. I hereby certified in the correctness of the foregoing resolution. Certified True and Correct: JENNIFER D. AVE Executive Secretary, UASG Attested: ERIKA GYNNE B. NABAS President, UASG Noted: NINIA ROSE M. ETORCITA, MSCS Adviser, UASG JEFFREY T. IMPORTANTE, MAEd                                              Co-Adviser, UASG                                                  Recommending approval: JOSE N. MAGBANUA, PhD Coordinator, Student Affairs and Services CHARLENE JOY R. AMAR, PhD Director of Academic Affairs  JULIET D. SALVACION, MPA Director for Administration and Finance Approved by: PORFERIO S. BANGCAYA, PhD Campus Director  EXCERPTS FROM THE MINUTES OF THE SPECIAL MEETING OF THE UNIVERSITY OF ANTIQUE STUDENT GOVERNMENT HELD ON NOVEMBER 23, 2025, FROM 2:00 TO 4:30 PM VIA ZOOM PRESENT: 28 ABSENT: 15 Resolution Author: BRAIN JECK G. REYNO               BLGA Representative, UASG LIST OF OFFICERS President: Erika Gynne B. Nabas Vice President: Marichu T. Lapesora Senators: Jupet F. Espartero Nicole Pongyan Jay Razel C. Fransisco Reuel Nathaniel M. Alvarez Roger J. Coria Florence Rameli G. Bandoja Nemfa P. Ponayo Pablito B. Samillano Jr. Edcel John B. Marquez Riza P. Arnaiz Jerald T. Barrientos James Isaac F. Guantia Representatives:LHS (JHS): Celeste Marie I. FloresLHS (SHS): Andrea Leigh P. EroCTE (BEED): Arrianne E. NabasCTE (BSED): Roxanne Jane S. Motus  CBM (BSHM): James Francis F. Garcia CBM (BLGA): Brain Jeck G. Reyno CBM (BSE): Divony V. Majabague CCS (BSIS): Lorie E. BelarioCCS (BSCS): Greg A. Labrador CCS (BSIT): Kate E. CalawodCOF(BSFi): Kim Jenny Pearl D. Samar Executive Branch:Secretary: Jennifer D. AveTreasurer: Marrianne PagsuguironAuditor: Princess Mae D. NabasBusiness Manager: Jan Russell Amar Asst. Business Manager: Jhero M. AlorroInternal Affairs Officer: Raiza Mae DoloricaExternal Affairs Officer: Kirstie GindapPRO: Cedrick Jay C. Dela CruzAssistant PRO: Jiezel A. SamillanoJudicial Branc