IANCE OF STUDENT GOVERNMENTS University of the Philippines - Visayas ACTIVITY DESIGN I. TITLE OF ACTIVITY    Leadership Training and Team Building Seminar for Student Government Officers II. DATE AND TIME     August 15-16, 2025 | 8:00 AM - 5:00 PM III. VENUE      University Conference Hall and Campus Grounds IV. OBJECTIVES     1. To develop effective leadership and governance skills among newly elected student government officers     2. To strengthen teamwork and collaboration among officers from different committees     3. To create an action plan for priority projects for the academic year 2025-2026     4. To build camaraderie and trust among student leaders V. PARTICIPANTS    - All elected officers of the Unified Alliance of Student Governments (25 officers)    - Committee chairpersons and vice-chairpersons (15 members)    - Total: 40 participants VI. RESOURCE SPEAKERS     1. Dr. Roberto Villanueva - Leadership and Governance Expert     2. Ms. Patricia Tan - Team Developm','Accomplishment Report',33.22,'processed','2026-05-19 15:17:38','2026-05-19 15:20:36'),(24,51,'UNIFIED ALLIANCE OF STUDENT GOVERNMENTS University of the Philippines - Visayas ACTIVITY DESIGN I. TITLE OF ACTIVITY    Leadership Training and Team Building Seminar for Student Government Officers II. DATE AND TIME     August 15-16, 2025 | 8:00 AM - 5:00 PM III. VENUE      University Conference Hall and Campus Grounds IV. OBJECTIVES     1. To develop effective leadership and governance skills among newly elected student government officers     2. To strengthen teamwork and collaboration among officers from different committees     3. To create an action plan for priority projects for the academic year 2025-2026     4. To build camaraderie and trust among student leaders V. PARTICIPANTS    - All elected officers of the Unified Alliance of Student Governments (25 officers)    - Committee chairpersons and vice-chairpersons (15 members)    - Total: 40 participants VI. RESOURCE SPEAKERS     1. Dr. Roberto