F THE STUDY In academic institutions, particularly within student governance bodies, the efficient management of official documents is critical to maintaining transparency, accountability, and operational effectiveness. At the University of Antique Tario-Lim Memorial Campus (UATLMC), the Student Government plays a vital role in coordinating activities, managing resources, and communicating with stakeholders. This responsibility involves handling a diverse range of documents such as communication letters, resolutions, budget proposals, activity designs, and accomplishment reports that must be accurately stored, retrieved, and tracked. However, the current document management practices within the UATLMC Student Government are predominantly manual and fragmented. Documents are often stored in personal folders, physical cabinets, or shared informally through messaging platforms. The lack of a centralized and structured document repository has caused recur','Activity Design',61.06,'processed','2026-05-19 21:40:40','2026-05-19 21:40:42'),(116,150,'UNIVERSITY OF ANTIQUE STUDENT GOVERNMENT tlmc.usg@antiquespride.edu.ph March 11, 2025 MR. ROY BANDOJA Director, Sports Development Unit University of Antique Tario-Lim Memorial Campus Dear Sir Roy, Warm greetings from the University of Antique Student Government! The University of Antique Tario Lim Memorial Campus Student Government (UASG) serve as the primary organization that connects the University Administration and the student body. The UASG represents the voice and interests of the students, enabling them to elect representatives to lead for the Academic Year 2025-2026. In line with this the University of Antique- Tario Lim Memorial Campus (UASG) will conduct an Acquaintance Party to strengthen relationships among students to foster camaraderie, respect, and uniting students as one community. Very truly yours, JESSICA N. DAYONOT UASG, Senator Noted by: JERU AVRIL CRYZ UASG, Vice President NINA M. ETORCITA Adviser, UASG','Activity Design',69.73,'processed','2026-05-19 21:41:51','2026-05-23 01:34:59'),(117,151,'UNIVERSITY OF ANTIQUE STUDENT GOVERNMENT tlmc.usg@antiquespride.edu.ph March 11, 2025 MR. ROY BANDOJA Director, Sports Development Unit University of Antique Tario-Lim Memorial Campus Dear Sir Roy, Warm greetings from the University of Antique Student Government! The University of Antique Tario Lim Memorial Campus Student Government (UASG) serve as the primary organization that connects the University Administration and the student body. The UASG represents the voice and interests of the students, enabling them to elect representatives to lead for the Academic Year 2025-2026. In line with this the University of Antique- Tario Lim Memorial Campus (UASG) will conduct an Acquaintance Party to strengthen relationships among students to foster camaraderie, respect, and uniting students as one community. Very truly yours, JESSICA N. DAYONOT UASG, Senator Noted by: JERU AVRIL CRYZ UASG, Vice President NINA M. ETORCITA Adviser, UASG','Activity Design',69.73,'processed','2026-05-19 22:48:53','2026-05-23 01:34:59'),(118,153,'UNIVERSITY OF ANTIQUE STUDENT GOVERNMENT tlmc.usg@antiquespride.edu.ph March 11, 2025 MR. ROY BANDOJA Director, Sports Development Unit University of Antique Tario-Lim Memorial Campus Dear Sir Roy, Warm greetings from the University of Antique Student Government! The University of Antique Tario Lim Memorial Campus Student Government (UASG) serve as the primary organization that connects the University Administration and the student body. The UASG represents the voice and interests of the students, enabling them to elect representatives to lead for the Academic Year 2025-2026. In line with this the University of Antique- Tario Lim Memorial Campus (UASG) will conduct an Acquaintance Party to strengthen relationships among students to foster camaraderie, respect, and uniting students as one community. Very truly yours, JESSICA N. DAYONOT UASG, Senator Noted by: JERU AVRI